  "question": {
    "text": "For a hypothetical H-like atom, which follows Bohr model, some spectral lines are observed as shown. If it is known that line E belong to visible region., then the line, which possibly belong to U.V. region is/are? <math><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is not necessarily the ground state)<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0058_01e1e72c30d0.png\" style=\"max-width:\"100%\"; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 170px; height: 110px;\" />"
  },
