  "solution": {
    "text": "Line E belong to visible so <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> will be 2.<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0058_4b50a44e579a.png\" style=\"max-width:\"100%\"; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 140px;\" /><br /><br />For E, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.138</mn></math><br /><br />For D, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.083</mn></math><br /><br />For C, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.034</mn></math><br /><br />For A, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.21</mn></math><br /><br />For B, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.07</mn></math><br /><br />For <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math> for A is larger than that of E, so it means line A belong to U.V. region."
